I'll say it again for those who didn't get it the first time:

*Praying does NOT improve your relations with your god.*
When your god helps you, you must wait before you can pray again.
What you are waiting for is for you to be reconciled with your 
god for having the temerity to disturb him/her. Sacrificing can
speed this up, but if you want good stuff you must sacrifice when
your god is not disturbed/angry (after your prayer timeout).
Even better if your luck is very high!

